# game_state_manager.md

## Purpose
`GameStateManager` maintains lightweight run metrics that gameplay systems and UI overlays read to provide feedback to the player.

## Responsibilities
- Track the current score and remaining lives as integer counters.
- Expose helpers such as `AddScore`, `LoseLife`, `GetScore`, and `GetLives` so callers do not touch raw fields.
- Report when the session has ended via `IsGameOver`.

The component is intentionally small but remains essential for minimal gameplay loops and debugging overlays.
